    "The cumulative distribution function, cdf is the integral of pdf from $x'=-\\infty$ to $x'=x$:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\mathrm{cdf}(x|\\mu,\\sigma) = \\int_{-\\infty}^{x'} p(x'|\\mu,\\sigma) dx',$$\n",
    "\n",
    "where $\\mathrm{cdf}(\\infty) = 1$. "
   ]
